description:
P2 regression: In `fragmentation_vectors.rs` (lines 153-155), the SHA-256 verification of test vector packet contents was replaced with no-op assignments:

Old:
```rust
let digest = Sha256::digest(expand(packet));
let expected = decode_hex(vector.packet_sha256.as_ref().unwrap());
assert_eq!(&digest[..], expected);
```

New:
```rust
let _data = expand(packet);
let _expected = vector.packet_sha256.as_ref().unwrap();
```

This removes an important integrity check that ensures test vector JSON hasn't been corrupted. The sha2 import was also removed.
